{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 114,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        527.1995849609375,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The high complexity reverse hybridization-based NAATs meet some preferences and values",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.988643646240234,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        369.01116943359375,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "of   and  , in that the current test: laboratory staff clinicians",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9259033203125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "provides quicker results about pyrazinamide resistance than other available methods",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        190.1048126220703,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. culture DST);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        408.63189697265625,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "can provide information on different concentration levels; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        392.8359680175781,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "targets a drug that is widely used in first-line TB treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.86609649658203,
        162.34820556640625,
        156.39910888671875,
        175.2292022705078
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.31922912597656,
        305.39483642578125,
        199.2332305908203
      ],
      "text": "What would be the impact on health equity?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.66912841796875,
        526.8236694335938,
        221.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "The impact on health equity would be similar to that of moderate complexity automated NAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946218490600586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.66912841796875,
        237.48065185546875,
        235.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "(Section 2.1.2), plus the following:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.4210205078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        255.56602478027344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        242.4210205078125,
        526.9313354492188,
        255.56602478027344
      ],
      "text": "Lengthy diagnostic delays, underuse of diagnostics, lack of TB diagnostic facilities at lower",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        257.9210205078125,
        526.9752807617188,
        271.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "levels and too many eligibility restrictions hamper access to prompt and accurate testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        273.4210205078125,
        327.2226257324219,
        286.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "and treatment, particularly for vulnerable groups.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        289.1080322265625,
        189.82545471191406,
        301.989013671875
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        304.6080322265625,
        376.74847412109375,
        317.489013671875
      ],
      "text": "Applicability to three index tests also confirmed in interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.9210205078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        333.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        319.9210205078125,
        526.9652099609375,
        333.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "Staff and managers voiced concerns about the sustainability of funding and maintenance,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        335.4210205078125,
        526.77587890625,
        348.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "complex conflicts of interest between donors and implementers, and the strategic and equitable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        350.9210205078125,
        527.03955078125,
        364.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "use of resources, which makes it difficult to ensure equitable access to cartridge-based diagnostics.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        366.6080322265625,
        187.27345275878906,
        379.489013671875
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.9210205078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        395.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        381.9210205078125,
        527.1624145507812,
        395.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "For patients, access to clear, comprehensible and dependable information on what TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        397.4210205078125,
        526.9688720703125,
        410.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "diagnostics are available to them and how to interpret results is a vital component of equity;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972365379333496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        412.9210205078125,
        393.89288330078125,
        426.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "lack of such access represents an important barrier for patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        428.6080322265625,
        134.57240295410156,
        441.489013671875
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.9210205078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        457.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        443.9210205078125,
        527.2749633789062,
        457.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "New treatment options need to be matched with new diagnostics: it is important to improve",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958069801330566,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        459.4210205078125,
        526.599853515625,
        472.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "access to treatment based on new diagnostics, and to improve access to diagnostics for new",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971863746643066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        474.9210205078125,
        177.14129638671875,
        488.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "treatment options.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        490.6080322265625,
        134.57240295410156,
        503.489013671875
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.9210205078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        519.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        505.9210205078125,
        526.6109619140625,
        519.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "The speed at which WHO guidelines are changing does not match the speed at which many",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979230880737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        521.4210205078125,
        526.9642333984375,
        534.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "country programmes are able to implement the guidelines. This translates into differential",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        536.9210205078125,
        301.9456481933594,
        550.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "access to new TB diagnostics and treatment:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        552.4210205078125,
        95.91809844970703,
        565.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        552.4210205078125,
        526.9808959960938,
        565.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "between countries (i.e. between those that can and cannot quickly keep up with the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        567.9210205078125,
        348.1429748535156,
        581.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "rapidly changing TB diagnostic environment); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        583.4210205078125,
        526.9645385742188,
        596.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "within countries (i.e. between patients who can and cannot afford the private health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        583.4540405273438,
        93.1460952758789,
        597.47900390625
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        598.9210205078125,
        483.4591979980469,
        612.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "system that is better equipped to quickly adopt new diagnostics and policies).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        614.6080322265625,
        153.39910888671875,
        627.489013671875
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.5789794921875,
        336.63482666015625,
        651.4929809570312
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention acceptable to key stakeholders?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        662.4288940429688,
        78.81920623779297,
        675.5739135742188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        662.4288940429688,
        527.1622924804688,
        675.5739135742188
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability of a high complexity reverse hybridization-based NAAT depends on how",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        677.9288940429688,
        526.9214477539062,
        691.0739135742188
      ],
      "text": "well the test performs on different samples, because laboratory staff question how well",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        693.4288940429688,
        526.9093017578125,
        706.5739135742188
      ],
      "text": "LPA methods work on smear-negative samples. If samples need to be cultured before the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        708.9288940429688,
        526.9307861328125,
        722.0739135742188
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide LPA is run, this may undermine the benefits of this method’s quicker turnaround",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        724.4288940429688,
        526.9752197265625,
        737.5739135742188
      ],
      "text": "time compared with phenotypic DST for pyrazinamide. Acceptability also depends on how",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        739.9288940429688,
        526.96435546875,
        753.0739135742188
      ],
      "text": "well the test actually detects mutations specific to pyrazinamide resistance; clinicians and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "98 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}